  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:zeh_beni_bekhori">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/1"/>This, my first born son,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/2"/>is the first issue of his mother's womb,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/3"/>and the Holy One, blessed is He
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/4"/>has commanded to redeem him,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/5"/>as it is said:
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/18/16"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/6"/>And those that are to be redeemed of them,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/7"/>from a month old shall you redeem them,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/8"/>according to your estimation,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/9"/>for the money of five silver shekalim,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/10"/>of the shekel of the Sanctuary
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/11"/>which is equal to twenty <tei:hi rend="italic">geirah.</tei:hi><tei:anchor xml:id="note_1"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/12"/>And it is said:
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:exodus/13/2"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/13"/>Sanctify unto me all the firstborn,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/14"/>whatsoever opens the womb
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/15"/>among the Children of Israel,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/16"/>both of man and of beast is Mine.<tei:anchor xml:id="note_2"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/>
<tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en"><tei:hi rend="italic">The father then places before the Kohein silver dollars in the amount of fiveshekalim which is equal to five silver dollars, or according to some Poskim seven silver dollars, and the Kohein asks:</tei:hi></tei:note>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/17"/>Which do you prefer,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/18"/>to give me your firstborn son
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/19"/>who is the first issue of his mother's womb,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/20"/>or would you rather redeem him
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/21"/>for five shekalim,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/22"/>as you are required to do by the Torah?
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en"><tei:hi rend="italic">The father replies:</tei:hi></tei:note>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/23"/>I wish to redeem my son
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/24"/>and here is the value of his redemption
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/25"/>which I am required to give
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zeh_beni_bekhori/26"/>according to the Torah.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
